        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>找出长难句的主干谓语动词的三个步骤</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #222;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 765px;\n      position: relative;\n      padding-top: 58px;\n    }\n    .content {\n      width: 456px;\n      margin-left: 42px;\n    }\n    .title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      letter-spacing: .25px;\n      margin: 0 0 17px 1px;\n    }\n    .step {\n      display: inline-block;\n      font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n      background: #e7edf5;\n      padding: 0 3px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 456px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      background: #dce9f5;\n    }\n    th, td {\n      border: 1px solid #cedce9;\n    }\n    th {\n      height: 39px;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 10px;\n    }\n    th:first-child { width: 84px; }\n    td.label {\n      width: 84px;\n      text-align: center;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      line-height: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      position: relative;\n      padding: 3px 2px;\n    }\n    td.desc {\n      vertical-align: top;\n      padding: 8px 6px 5px 6px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n    }\n    tr.r1 { height: 103px; }\n    tr.r2 { height: 104px; }\n    tr.r3 { height: 104px; }\n    tr.r4 { height: 105px; }\n    tr.r5 { height: 72px; }\n\n    .mark {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: #ffe58a;\n      min-width: 18px;\n      height: 13px;\n      vertical-align: -2px;\n      margin: 0 1px;\n    }\n    .ex {\n      margin-top: 5px;\n      padding: 3px 4px 3px 5px;\n      min-height: 38px;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          rgba(255,255,255,.66) 0,\n          rgba(255,255,255,.66) 13px,\n          #c7d7e5 14px,\n          rgba(255,255,255,.66) 15px\n        );\n      border-top: 1px dashed #bdcfdf;\n      border-bottom: 1px dashed #bdcfdf;\n      color: #454545;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 14px;\n    }\n    .hl {\n      color: #b97846;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      background: linear-gradient(transparent 42%, #ffe68c 42%, #ffe68c 91%, transparent 91%);\n    }\n    .strike {\n      text-decoration-line: line-through;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    }\n    .small-note {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      line-height: 16px;\n    }\n    .bottom-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 707px;\n      left: 268px;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n      font-size: 8px;\n    }\n    .watermark {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 28px;\n      bottom: 56px;\n      width: 103px;\n      height: 78px;\n      opacity: .08;\n      border-radius: 48% 48% 45% 45%;\n      background: #e8ba55;\n      transform: rotate(-13deg);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"title\">找出长难句的主干谓语动词的三个步骤：</div>\n      <div class=\"step\">Step1:看标点，找分句（快速锁定主干的位置——聚焦）</div>\n\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>标点</th>\n            <th>说明</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"r1\">\n            <td class=\"label\">介词等<span class=\"mark\"></span></td>\n            <td class=\"desc\">\n              若前半句为介词短语（of……）；从句（When……）；非谓语短语（done sth……），则<br>\n              另半句为主干，之后找出【从句分支：宾语补语】\n              <div class=\"ex\">\n                <span class=\"strike\">At the end of adolescence, however,</span> <span class=\"hl\">the brain shuts down half of that capacity,</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">preserving only those modes of thought that have seemed most valuable during the first</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">decade or so of life.</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r2\">\n            <td class=\"label\">主干<span class=\"mark\"></span>并列句</td>\n            <td class=\"desc\">\n              分号相当于连词 and、but、or，前半句是主干，后半句是并列句\n              <div class=\"ex\">\n                <span class=\"hl\">Progress in both areas is undoubtedly necessary for the social，political and</span><br>\n                <span class=\"hl\">intellectual development of these and all other societies；</span><span class=\"strike\">however, the conventional</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">view that education should be one of the very highest priorities for promoting rapid</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">economic development in poorer countries is wrong.</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r3\">\n            <td class=\"label\">主干<span class=\"mark\"></span>同位语</td>\n            <td class=\"desc\">\n              冒号后面是补充、说明、解释，所以相当于同位语。\n              <div class=\"ex\">\n                <span class=\"hl\">The researchers’ argument stems from a simple observation about social influence：</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">with the exception of a few celebrities like Oprah Winfrey—whose outsized presence is</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">primarily a function of their enormous wealth—influence—even the most influential</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">members of a population simply don’t spread with that many others.</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r4\">\n            <td class=\"label\">主干<span class=\"mark\"></span>同位语</td>\n            <td class=\"desc\">\n              破折号后面是补充、说明、解释，所以相当于同位语。\n              <div class=\"ex\">\n                <span class=\"hl\">Yet the researchers revealed that the executives at Honda, Nissan and Toyota</span><br>\n                <span class=\"hl\">achieved about 95 percent of the productivity of their Japanese counterparts</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">—a fact that surprised the reigning theory of worker motivation at the time.</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"r5\">\n            <td class=\"label\">插入语<br><span class=\"mark\"></span>插入语/主干</td>\n            <td class=\"desc\">\n              主语谓语之间是插入语，而主语常为名词短语和介词短语，中间可能为主干\n              <div class=\"ex\">\n                <span class=\"strike\">Washington，who had begun to believe that all men were created equal after observing</span><br>\n                <span class=\"strike\">the bravery of the black soldiers during the Revolutionary War，</span><span class=\"hl\">overcame the strong</span><br>\n                <span class=\"hl\">opposition of his relatives to grant his slaves their freedom in his will.</span>\n              </div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"watermark\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-number\">5</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
